1
00:00:00,888 --> 00:00:02,718
(Sheldon:)Okay.

2
00:00:02,723 --> 00:00:04,753
As my future neighbor,

3
00:00:04,759 --> 00:00:07,589
(Sheldon:)I'd like you to have a key.

4
00:00:09,530 --> 00:00:13,970
(Sheldon:)Initial here to acknowledge
you received it.

5
