You're taking this really well.

6
00:00:16,404 --> 00:00:18,244
(Sheldon:)Well, it's not like I'm never
going to see you two again.

7
00:00:18,267 --> 00:00:21,397
(Sheldon:)Which brings us to
article 23 subsection C...

8
00:00:21,690 --> 00:00:23,920
(Sheldon:)please check here
to reserve your spot

9
00:00:23,925 --> 00:00:26,605
(Sheldon:)at the ten year
roommate reunion.

10
00:00:27,558 --> 00:00:29,168
(Leonard:)Do I really have to do that now?

11
00:00:29,672 --> 00:00:31,002
(Sheldon:)No, but if you want chicken

12
00:00:31,007 --> 00:00:33,437
(Sheldon:)and get stuck with the fish,
that's on you.

13
00:00:34,644 --> 00:00:36,044
(Sheldon:)All right.

14
00:00:36,045 --> 00:00:37,875
(Sheldon:)Oh, and lastly,

15
00:00:37,880 --> 00:00:39,710
(Sheldon:)please initial here to confirm

16
00:00:39,715 --> 00:00:41,215
(Sheldon:)that ownership
of the living room couch

17
00:00:41,217 --> 00:00:42,417
(Sheldon:)is hereby transferred to me

18
00:00:42,418 --> 00:00:44,418
(Sheldon:)in perpetuity
all throughout the universe

19
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:46,290
(Sheldon:)and all alternate universes

20
00:00:46,289 --> 00:00:48,389
(Sheldon:)except for those universes
where owning a couch

21
00:00:48,391 --> 00:00:50,021
(Sheldon:)is forbidden by the hive queen.

22
00:00:50,026 --> 00:00:52,196
(Sheldon:)In which case,
all glory to the hive queen.

23
